{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"At this moment, after 3 p.m., I arrive here; I could immediately depart for Paris at 5 o'clock; but according to my usual system, I intend to rest again. So I am, in fact, in France! Evening. I have already had myself registered in the Lafitte diligence in the Coupé; that is the front compartment of the carriage; there are three boxes one behind the other; the middle one is called l'interieur and the rear one Cabriolet; the Coupé has 3 seats side by side, facing forward, and is closed with windows, not open, like the so-called Cabriolets on our express post coaches. Before dinner I briefly viewed the city somewhat, the cathedral from the outside and especially the view from a part of the rampart, which is most charming; the valley, through which the Moselle flows, bounded by gentle hills, wider, richer in buildings and villages, and more attractive than the surroundings of Dresden. Since Metz is a significant fortress, the garrison is numerous. After dinner I went to the theater, which was full of officers; hardly a dozen women and civilians; List against List, — also in Germany on the theater, — and then a Vaudeville, all nonsensical — and very cold — stuff, but played and spoken with such liveliness that I understood hardly a word, especially from the wretched singing."}}],"created":1795080515,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":289,"prompt_tokens":404,"total_tokens":693,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-MONLTmPCfa6w3tRgxcLty1KAOnM1lMsN","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":404,"prompt_ms":537.338,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.3300445544554456,"prompt_per_second":751.8545124297929,"predicted_n":289,"predicted_ms":6896.499,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.946177083333332,"predicted_per_second":41.76031925764073}}